vely. This compatibility wrapper only passes atoms to its child\nfunction and adds no subscription logic."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-vuetabletfeatures-tdata","text":"Type Alias: VueTable<TFeatures, TData>","level":1},{"id":"type-declaration","text":"Type Declaration","level":2},{"id":"subscribe","text":"Subscribe","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"props","text":"props","level":5},{"id":"children","text":"children","level":6},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"deprecated","text":"Deprecated","level":4},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: VueTable\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\n```ts\ntype VueTable<TFeatures, TData> = Table<TFeatures, TData> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [useTable.ts:46](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/useTable.ts#L46)\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### ~~Subscribe~~\n\n```ts\nSubscribe: (props) => VNode | VNode[];\n```\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### props\n\n###### children\n\n(`atoms`) => `VNode` \\| `VNode`[]\n\n#### Returns\n\n`VNode` \\| `VNode`[]\n\n#### Deprecated\n\nRead table APIs or `table.atoms` directly inside templates,\nrender functions, computed values, or watcher sources. Vue tracks those\nreads natively. This compatibility wrapper only passes atoms to its child\nfunction and adds no subscription logic.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: VueTable\ntitle: VueTable\n---\n\n# Type Alias: VueTable\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\n```ts\ntype VueTable<TFeatures, TData> = Table<TFeatures, TData> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [useTable.ts:46](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/useTable.ts#L46)\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### ~~Subscribe~~\n\n```ts\nSubscribe: (props) => VNode | VNode[];\n```\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### props\n\n###### children\n\n(`atoms`) => `VNode` \\| `VNode`[]\n\n#### Returns\n\n`VNode` \\| `VNode`[]\n\n#### Deprecated\n\nRead table APIs or `table.atoms` directly inside templates,\nrender functions, computed values, or watcher sources. Vue tracks those\nreads natively. This compatibility wrapper only passes atoms to its child\nfunction and adds no subscription logic.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n"}
